  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JP Action for Girls and Young Women in Mozambique</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Action for Girls and Young Women&apos;s Sexual and Reproductive Health and Rights in Mozambique is a UN joint programme that emphasizes behavioural and social change practices to shift attitudes that negatively affect young women. as The  Rapariga Biz, the programme removes barriers for young women and promote access the sexual and reproductive health rights services they want and need.</narrative>
  </description>
